# Changed paths matching these globs need only the always-run set (.aien/always).
# Everything else must be covered by a manifest's inputs or the commit is NOT_RUN.
# Conservative: several hosted workflows path-filter on docs/ and evidence/ subtrees,
# so only the repository's top-level prose is listed. Read from the base ref.
LICENSE
.gitignore
README.md
CONTRIBUTORS.md
# Crumbs are advisory notes, never a merge check (RFC-0003 Amendment 2). `*` spans slashes.
*.crumb
.crumbignore
